Team,

Effective 2026-09-18, MARKET_CODE and MARKET_NAME on CUSTOMER_DEMOGRAPHICS, and
COUNTRY_CODE on CUSTOMER_ADDRESS, will change from ISO abbreviations to full
country names.

Example: 'US' will become 'United States'.

Please assess downstream impact on your pipelines and confirm readiness by
2026-09-10.

